      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is this one `update` instead of `update binding` to be consistent with the `insert binding` and `remove binding`? (I guess same question for `destroy` instead of `destroy binding`)\n\n(Or, should the other two drop the ` binding` so then it\u0027s just `destroy`, `update`, `insert` and `remove`?",
