      "writtenOn": "2025-12-16T15:28:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was thinking about it while making this CL. For now this follows the IDL in https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/blob/main/proposals/bindless.md\n\n```\npartial interface GPUResourceTable {\n    void update(GPUIndex32 slot, GPUBindingResource resource);\n    GPUIndex32 insertBinding(GPUBindingResource resource);\n    void removeBinding(GPUIndex32 slot);\n};\n```\n\nI\u0027ll open an issue on the WG to discuss renaming with shorter names and will rename in Dawn when that happens.\n\nhttps://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/issues/5491",
